sequenceDiagram
  participant S as booking.service.ts
  participant E as lib/infra/resend/
  participant R as Resend API
  participant IN as Email Inbox

  Note over S: Booking or cancellation event

  S->>E: sendBookingConfirmation(email, data)
  Note over E: wrapped in try/catch\nnever rethrows

  E->>R: resend.emails.send({ to, subject, html })
  alt success
    R-->>E: { id }
    E-->>S: void (non-blocking)
  else Resend error
    R-->>E: error
    E->>E: logger.error(...)\nsilently swallowed
    E-->>S: void (non-blocking)
  end

  Note over S: booking operation\ncontinues regardless
